Build the book into target/book (warnings are errors), then check every internal link; needs mdbook, mdbook-mermaid-ssr, a headless browser and lychee

Usage: cargo xtask docs build [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --site-url <path>
          The published site's path, for absolute links

  -h, --help
          Print help
